9. Security Considerations
9.1 Authentication & Authorization

JWT tokens: Short-lived access tokens (15 minutes)
Refresh tokens: Long-lived, stored securely (7 days)
Role-based access control (RBAC)
API rate limiting: Per user and IP address

9.2 Data Security

Encryption at rest: Database encryption
Encryption in transit: TLS/SSL for all communications
Secrets management: Kubernetes Secrets, HashiCorp Vault
Password hashing: bcrypt with high cost factor

9.3 Network Security

Service mesh: Istio for mTLS between services
Network policies: Kubernetes NetworkPolicies
API Gateway: DDoS protection, request validation
WAF (Web Application Firewall): CloudFlare or similar


